    "description": "<p><em>o mestre dos sistemas</em> — <em>base: Niilógico</em></p><p>Especialização de Técnico, para Afiliação <strong>Rebelde</strong>, escolhida no <strong>5º nível</strong>. Mantém tudo o que o Técnico já lhe deu, e as habilidades da classe seguem na ficha.</p><p><strong>Progressão do Slicer — do 5º ao 20º nível</strong></p><table><thead><tr><th>Nv</th><th>DV</th><th>BA</th><th>JP</th><th>Operar Máq.</th><th>NT</th><th>Sabotagem (1/3)</th><th>Reprogramar robôs</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>5</strong></td><td>5</td><td>+3</td><td>14</td><td>84%</td><td>3º</td><td>15%</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td><strong>6</strong></td><td>6</td><td>+3</td><td>14</td><td>85%</td><td>–</td><td>20%</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7</strong></td><td>7</td><td>+3</td><td>13</td><td>86%</td><td>4º</td><td>20%</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td><strong>8</strong></td><td>8</td><td>+4</td><td>13</td><td>87%</td><td>–</td><td>20%</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td><strong>9</strong></td><td>9</td><td>+4</td><td>13</td><td>88%</td><td>5º</td><td>25%</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td><strong>10</strong></td><td>+1</td><td>+4</td><td>12</td><td>89%</td><td>–</td><td>25%</td><td>Tabela 3-2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>11</strong></td><td>+1</td><td>+5</td><td>12</td><td>90%</td><td>6º</td><td>25%</td><td>Tabela 3-2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>12</strong></td><td>+2</td><td>+5</td><td>12</td><td>91%</td><td>–</td><td>25%</td><td>Tabela 3-2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>13</strong></td><td>+2</td><td>+5</td><td>11</td><td>92%</td><td>7º</td><td>25%</td><td>Tabela 3-2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>14</strong></td><td>+3</td><td>+6</td><td>11</td><td>93%</td><td>–</td><td>25%</td><td>Tabela 3-2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>15</strong></td><td>+3</td><td>+6</td><td>11</td><td>94%</td><td>8º</td><td>25%</td><td>Tabela 3-2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>16</strong></td><td>+4</td><td>+6</td><td>10</td><td>95%</td><td>–</td><td>25%</td><td>Tabela 3-2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>17</strong></td><td>+4</td><td>+7</td><td>10</t